Spin Efficiency
  Not pursuing for now. Trackman's own SpinAxis/Tilt is inferred from ball
  movement, not independently measured, so there's no second axis to compare
  it against -- true spin efficiency (transverse spin / total spin) needs
  transverse spin back-solved from the break via the Magnus-force physics
  model, not a formula droppable from the raw CSV columns with confidence.

